    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Young children (ages 3 - 6)  are struggling with labeling, expressing, and managing their emotions, especially when it comes to managing negative emotions. Children who have a higher emotional intelligence experience long term benefits to their mental health and wellbeing. They will develop resilience and coping skills, display fewer behavioral problems, and feel more confident and capable. Tingets is an interactive storytelling app that leverages the power of tangible play to take children through activities that strengthen their emotional communication and expression skills. With Tingets, children explore the world crafts by designing different characters with unique facial expressions and utilize artificial intelligence to make their creations come to life. Children will take their characters through different activities as they build their own voice and develop more emotional communication skills. With Tingets it is our goal to help children better understand their own and others’ emotions, develop a more granular emotional vocabulary, express emotions in a more constructive way, manage negative emotions and celebrate & cultivate positive emotions as well. \r\n\r\nWith over 100 different participants we have conducted a number of different research studies. We have run concept tests, play tests, parent surveys, in-person and digital interviews. We have seen kids share personal stories about how they feel with their parents and utilize the new words they are learning with Tingets to express themselves. It is our vision to make social and emotional learning accessible and fun for all kids.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
